WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.615 line:0
Current public-source candidate: a read-only tour of the isolated Hedera Testnet judge preview.

2
00:00:07.615 --> 00:00:15.971 line:0
Wallet-free preview reads the configured Chainlink HBAR/USD reference. No transaction is sent.

3
00:00:15.972 --> 00:00:22.281 line:0
The historical testnet transaction resolves to an event-bound receipt in the public reference registry.

4
00:00:22.282 --> 00:00:35.943 line:0
Read-only checks show local consistency, the exact historical oracle round, and the stored commitment match.

5
00:00:35.943 --> 00:00:48.046 line:0
Export receipt JSON downloads the real historical receipt for independent verification.

6
00:00:48.046 --> 00:00:56.714 line:0
Recorded standalone CLI evidence: four cases were measured earlier; this page is a labeled report, not live app UI.

7
00:00:56.714 --> 00:01:04.082 line:0
Genuine receipt: valid locally, historical observation matches, and stored record matches.

8
00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:11.430 line:0
A one-tinybar alteration fails local consistency before the external comparisons run.

9
00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:19.256 line:0
A recomputed amount passes arithmetic and oracle checks but differs from the stored commitment.

10
00:01:19.256 --> 00:01:27.093 line:0
A recomputed false price fails the historical oracle and stored commitment checks.

11
00:01:27.094 --> 00:01:38.940 line:0
This historical evidence does not prove payment, identity, or a currently payable price.
